    <!-- User Guide -->
    <string name="guide_title">User Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_sec1_title">1. General Usage</string>
    <string name="guide_sec1_content">The application consists of Order entry, Customer management, Stock tracking, and Shipping control stages. After creating your orders, you can approve them from the \'History\' tab and share them as PDF.</string>
    <string name="guide_sec2_title">2. Data Transfer with Excel</string>
    <string name="guide_sec2_content">Instead of adding your Stock and Customer cards one by one, you can upload them in bulk via Excel. The first row of your file should be the header, and data should start from the 2nd row.</string>
    <string name="guide_sec3_title">3. Shipping Tracking</string>
    <string name="guide_sec3_content">Approved orders become shippable. You can make partial shipments with the \'Ship\' button. When the quantity is entered, the system automatically calculates the \'Remaining\' quantity and updates the order status when completed.</string>
